# ====================== PHYSICS CONSTANTS (exact SI) ======================
# v300++++: ONE source of truth for the fundamental physical constants used across
# the whole digital-twin pipeline. Every value is the exact CODATA 2018 / WGS84
# defined value (no rounded 3e8 / 2.998e8 approximations). Centralizing these makes
