                "- SSE stream GET `/stream`: live entities/tracks/alerts/health",
                "- Secure mesh ingest POST `/` (headers `X-NEPA-TS`, `X-NEPA-SIG` = HMAC-SHA256 of `ts.body`)", "",
                "## Environment variables",
